              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili nomba Yoshua akuulile pa mulu wa lupili lwa Ebali ubulambo bwakwa Yawe, Lesa wakwa Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pamo ngefyo Mose umubomfi wakwa Yawe akonkomeshe abena Israeli. Akuulile ukulingana nefyo calembwa mu citabo ca Mafunde yakwa Mose ukuti, “Icibumba ca bulambo cifwile ukukuulilwa na mabwe ayashakomaulwamo ne cela, yalingile yabafye ayatuntulu.” Apa epo baletuulila umutuulo we lambo lya cakoca kuli Yawe kabili no mutuulo we lambo lyakwampana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili Yoshua, pa cinso ca bena Israeli, ayambwilile pa mabwe amafunde yantu Mose alembele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli bonse, abeni pamo pene na bakaya, abakalamba babo, bacilolo elyo na bakaputula wa milandu babo, baiminine ku mbali shonse isha Mbokoshi ya Cipangano cakwa Yawe, baloseshe amenso kuli bashimapepo abena Levi abalesenda Imbokoshi ya Cipangano cakwa Yawe. Citika wa bamo baiminine pantanshi ya lupili lwa Gerisimu, bambi nabo pantanshi ya lupili lwa Ebali ngefyo Mose umubomfi wakwa Yawe akonkomeshe kale ukucita pakupaala abena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na pa numa ya ifi fyonse, Yoshua abelengele yonse amashiwi ya Mafunde, amashiwi ya mapaalo elyo na mashiwi ya kulapisha ngefyo calembwa mu citabo ca Mafunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
